{
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "notes": "Added a new BLE 'signal'/'modem_status'/'cell_status' command: a quick cellular diagnostic (check_alive, check_sim, wait_for_registration up to 15s, then AT+CSQ) with NO AT+NETOPEN/data session -- a few seconds, not the 30-60s a full 'log'/'ota' cellular session can take. Reports 'signal: <CSQ line> (registered|not registered)' via command_result. This is the app-side equivalent of the 'Waiting for network registration... CSQ: ...' lines Thonny already shows during boot, now available without a laptop -- added specifically to support a new 'Check Signal' button in the phone app.",
